#: ../../Textbook_Creation_Help/example_aguaclara_rst.rst:168
msgid "Math is very cool, and works natively in RST using LaTeX math syntax. In-line math can be written with the following syntax: ``:math:`y = ax^2 + bx + c``` which displays :math:`y = ax^2 + bx + c`. To display equations in their own line, use the following syntax::"
